This directory will hold version-controlled benchmark recipe YAML files,
one per benchmark, per Section 5 of ../EVAL_SERVICE_PLAN.md ("The standard
recipe — we decide it, not the teams").

It is bind-mounted read-only into the backend container at /standards
(see ../docker-compose.yml), and will eventually be loaded into the
`recipe` table (Section 10) by backend/app/services/standards.

Empty for now — no standards have been written yet.
